<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AI on Miya</title><link>https://tuobaling.github.io/categories/ai/</link><description>Recent content in AI on Miya</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 21:05:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tuobaling.github.io/categories/ai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hermes Slash command new bug-You are not authorized to use this command.</title><link>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/hermes-slash-command-new-session-bug/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 21:05:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/hermes-slash-command-new-session-bug/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;問題：更新到5.7版後，到discord輸入”/new”後出現”You are not authorized to use this command.”&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Hermes Cli 卻出現選項選擇允許程度，可接下來無法輸入文字。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原因：&lt;a&#10; href="https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/22958"&#10; target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; class="md-link"&#10;&gt;&#10; https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/22958&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="md-image"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/1dce5fdc-84b8-4a67-b95a-ebdee75d40c4/e53386cb-2801-44d7-b801-b935b1dcd92c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466RFAUQMB6%2F20260822%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;amp;X-Amz-Date=20260822T003008Z&amp;amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEOj%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIDoLZa8sSrDnwdttujd9uhgudPR1vJKnB5fEROqJQYueAiEAhUfmZ3giDJKe%2FJvYJOEJeFWbQ9xBpHR5JneD9CRzg3MqiAQIsf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDDqQBcDw6JYoEPcYQSrcAzPcQZyReyaRvNsW9lmOcgi0rR7cGCR2tFW0loO3mZnMJUb06b9%2BWRjn8lMh5iz78pDx7d%2BNtY6SsyfTU